1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:50,520 --> 00:01:52,320
Invader, I will take your life !

25
00:02:02,520 --> 00:02:03,360
He's Core Formation ?

26
00:02:03,350 --> 00:02:04,960
Formation, activate !

27
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:08,200
Note: Wang Lin got this formation from the Evil Devil Sect disciples he killed.

28
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:17,120
Can this formation trap a Core Formation cultivator ?

29
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,920
If you were at Peak Late stage,

30
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:32,080
then this formation

31
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:33,840
might have stood a chance against me.

32
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:36,600
It's a shame you're just a Middle stage Foundation Establishment...

33
00:02:44,640 --> 00:02:45,440
Go !

34
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:04,880
I will kill you, I will kill you.

35
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:06,560
I'll slash you to death, bastard !

36
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:10,040
Foundation Establishment brat,

37
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:13,200
taste the power of Core Formation !

38
00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:15,800
That guy is cunning.

39
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:16,920
He would never attack

40
00:03:16,920 --> 00:03:18,080
without absolute certainty.

41
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,600
Could it be...

42
00:03:19,600 --> 00:03:21,320
Xu Liguo, what are you waiting for ?

43
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,440
Do you want to die ?

44
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:24,640
I knew it...

45
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:34,280
Damn heavens,

46
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:36,520
why is this my fate ?

47
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:39,080
But... If I devour a Core Formation cultivator,

48
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:40,960
my power might increase dramatically !

49
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:43,360
Then I will be able to kill my ungrateful master

50
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,200
and I'll be free

51
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:45,760
to roam through

52
00:03:45,760 --> 00:03:47,280
heaven and earth !

53
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:56,160
I'm done playing with you !

54
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,720
Your soul is restricted

55
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:01,080
and you can't escape my Bloodfiend Demon Formation.

56
00:04:11,160 --> 00:04:13,160
This Divine Sense is mine !

57
00:04:16,880 --> 00:04:18,560
Stop this !

58
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:20,080
No no no

59
00:04:20,280 --> 00:04:21,200
I'll give it back...

60
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:44,520
Come back

61
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:46,520
or I will kill you immediately.

62
00:04:57,840 --> 00:05:00,280
If the Evil Devil Sect's jade slip is correct

63
00:05:00,280 --> 00:05:02,480
then absorbing a Golden Core can boost my cultivation.

64
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:05,240
This is my key to Peak Late stage Foundation Establishment.

65
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,320
Where is he ?

66
00:05:15,320 --> 00:05:16,360
Find him !

67
00:05:16,400 --> 00:05:16,960
Understood !

68
00:05:29,200 --> 00:05:31,480
The spiritual energy in a Golden Core is immense !

69
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:48,680
Unfortunately, I can only absorb 10% of this energy

70
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:51,760
since I didn't cultivate the Great Freedom Asura Art.

71
00:05:56,760 --> 00:05:59,080
Congratulations Master on reaching Peak Late stage Foundation Establishment.

72
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:01,880
Wang Lin\NPeak Late stage\NFoundation Establishment

73
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:00,960
Scout ahead

74
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:02,360
instead of talking.

75
00:06:15,440 --> 00:06:16,350
Master...

76
00:06:16,400 --> 00:06:17,560
You haven't told me

77
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:18,920
where we're going to.

78
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:21,440
The Burning Fire Alliance.

79
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,200
Oh..

80
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:04,840
Very good.

81
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,440
At this rate,

82
00:07:06,760 --> 00:07:09,240
you might even win the Heaven Separating Pill.

83
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:10,680
However,

84
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:11,960
I'm wondering how

85
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:14,480
you were able to advance so quickly.

86
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,160
Just before,

87
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:18,880
you were Middle stage Foundation Establishment.

88
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:20,720
It's embarrassing but

89
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:23,520
Junior encountered a severely injured Core Formation cultivator.

90
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:24,720
To be able to defend myself,

91
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:26,280
I had no choice but to take his Golden Core.

92
00:07:26,880 --> 00:07:28,400
That's how my cultivation rose

93
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:30,360
to Peak Late stage Foundation Establishment.

94
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:38,280
This is the second map piece.

95
00:07:38,840 --> 00:07:40,680
When you fulfill your next task,

96
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:41,880
come to me

97
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:43,320
for the third piece.

98
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:50,680
Country of Xuanwu

99
00:07:50,860 --> 00:07:53,160
Burning Fire Country

100
00:07:53,400 --> 00:07:55,920
Nan Dou City

101
00:07:53,400 --> 00:07:55,920
Sea of Devils

102
00:07:52,280 --> 00:07:53,840
The continent's information

103
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:55,680
must be on that final map piece.

104
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:57,880
Thank you, Senior.

105
00:07:58,600 --> 00:07:59,480
Wang Lin,

106
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:01,960
the cultivators of Xuanwu have gathered

107
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:03,640
so a great battle is approaching.

108
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:05,560
Whether you are seeking

109
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:07,360
the map or the Heaven Separating Pill,

110
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:08,160
the next few days

111
00:08:08,320 --> 00:08:09,760
will be your best opportunity.

112
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:10,840
Fellow cultivators !

113
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,720
Fellow cultivators,

114
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:16,800
our Nascent Soul physical bodies were attacked

115
00:08:16,840 --> 00:08:18,480
and the Country Sealing Formation

116
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:19,640
has shattered...

117
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:22,800
The Fire Spirit Beasts are coming !

118
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:26,800
The Heaven Defying Bead absorbed the Fire Spirit Beast King

119
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:29,080
so I'm sure the Fire Spirit Beasts will look everywhere for me.

120
00:08:29,080 --> 00:08:30,600
I can't stay here anymore.

121
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:32,240
Forget the Heaven Separating Pill,

122
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:34,360
I need the map in order to return to Zhao.

123
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:45,880
Yang Xiong,

124
00:08:46,560 --> 00:08:48,280
why were you looking for me ?

125
00:08:56,160 --> 00:08:56,960
Senior...

126
00:08:57,320 --> 00:08:59,440
Master, I've done what you asked.

127
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:01,120
As for my Soul Blood...

128
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:11,600
I'm sorry.

129
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:18,960
Ancestor Feng Luan is my mother.

130
00:09:19,920 --> 00:09:20,760
When she saw me,

131
00:09:20,760 --> 00:09:22,360
she knew something was wrong.

132
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:23,560
So...

133
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:26,800
I didn't come for your Soul Blood.

134
00:09:27,760 --> 00:09:29,720
I just need your help for something.

135
00:09:30,800 --> 00:09:31,880
Is it about the map ?

136
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:34,360
My homeland is far away

137
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:36,440
and I have no way to find it

138
00:09:36,680 --> 00:09:37,960
without a map.

139
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:39,680
Then help me kill 2 people.

140
00:09:40,560 --> 00:09:42,040
You know them both.

141
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:45,320
The first is Ma Liang's childhood friend Xu Si

142
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:47,080
and the other

143
00:09:47,280 --> 00:09:49,240
is that scoundrel Zhou An who's been with her.

144
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:51,560
I trust you, Senior.

145
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:53,120
Come back in an hour

146
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:54,640
and I'll give you the map.

147
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:57,160
Deal.

148
00:09:58,520 --> 00:09:59,320
Ma Liang...

149
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:02,600
This is the last thing I can do for you...

150
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:05,400
Disgusting...

151
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:08,240
Who would've thought Ma Liang

152
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:09,760
would actually return alive ?

153
00:10:10,160 --> 00:10:11,140
Are you

154
00:10:11,160 --> 00:10:12,560
still thinking about him ?

155
00:10:14,920 --> 00:10:16,320
Of course not.

156
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:18,800
Don't you feel that

157
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:20,080
since he returned,

158
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:21,760
he seemed like a different person ?

159
00:10:23,280 --> 00:10:24,840
A mere Foundation Establishment cultivator

160
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:26,080
being so high profile

161
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:28,360
cannot end well for him.

162
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:30,520
Ma Liang,

163
00:10:31,520 --> 00:10:33,720
I will kill the person you once loved

164
00:10:33,760 --> 00:10:35,880
but that has heartlessly abandoned you.

165
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:38,560
I wonder how you would feel

166
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:40,480
if you were still here.

167
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:44,360
Xu Si... Xu Si !

168
00:10:47,760 --> 00:10:49,440
You two were doomed anyway.

169
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:52,440
Not just because of my promise to Zhou Zihong,

170
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:54,360
but because

171
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:57,840
I will never leave any potential danger behind anymore.

172
00:11:16,440 --> 00:11:18,240
The Sea of Devils

173
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:21,280
is like hell on earth.

174
00:11:21,280 --> 00:11:24,040
It's filled with a malevolent aura.

175
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:26,640
The cultivators here

176
00:11:26,640 --> 00:11:29,200
are cunning like foxes,

177
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:31,280
treacherous and ruthless.

178
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:34,560
Most of them come from the outside

179
00:11:34,560 --> 00:11:36,560
but their rebellious nature

180
00:11:36,560 --> 00:11:38,000
or their bloody past

181
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:39,800
forced them to flee.

182
00:11:40,160 --> 00:11:42,760
They all end up gathering here

183
00:11:42,760 --> 00:11:46,400
in the Sea of Devils where everyone cultivates

184
00:11:46,840 --> 00:11:48,920
like a Devil.

185
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:59,360
This Sea of Devils is too dangerous.

186
00:11:59,680 --> 00:12:02,040
I'm only at Peak Late stage Foundation Establishment...

187
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:03,600
If I want to return to Zhao,

188
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:05,320
it will be extremely difficult.

189
00:12:06,160 --> 00:12:07,440
Young lady,

190
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:10,760
I have killed every single member of your squad.

191
00:12:10,760 --> 00:12:12,600
Do you think you can run away ?

192
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:25,400
The Luo River Sect has been testing poisons for generations,

193
00:12:25,400 --> 00:12:26,800
if you're not afraid...

194
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:30,160
It's too dangerous for a girl to do alchemy and test poisons.

195
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:35,080
Wouldn't it be awesome to have someone

196
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:36,480
for Dual Cultivation ?

197
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:46,560
He's Middle stage Core Formation.

198
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:48,050
I can't handle him without

199
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:49,280
the Bloodfiend Demon Formation.

200
00:12:49,920 --> 00:12:52,120
A Junior who knows the Earth Escape Technique ?

201
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:55,920
Since we've met,

202
00:12:55,920 --> 00:12:57,760
I might as well kill you too !

203
00:13:04,760 --> 00:13:05,560
Senior !

204
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:06,800
Save me.

205
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:11,720
Senior,

206
00:13:11,720 --> 00:13:13,520
he's from Xuanwu's Dual Cultivation Sect.

207
00:13:13,760 --> 00:13:15,960
He knows that I have a Heaven Separating Pill.

208
00:13:16,320 --> 00:13:17,880
If Senior can save me...

209
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:21,000
He can't save you.

210
00:13:41,400 --> 00:13:43,400
Do you really have a Heaven Separating Pill ?

211
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:46,280
We are both from the Burning Fire Alliance.

212
00:13:46,280 --> 00:13:47,600
Even if he's a madman,

213
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:49,080
falling into his hands

214
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:52,640
is better than being caught by that Core Formation from Xuanwu.

215
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:55,360
I don't have a complete Heaven Separating Pill,

216
00:13:55,400 --> 00:13:57,200
just a half-finished product.

217
00:13:57,800 --> 00:13:59,560
The Luo River Sect's Heaven Separating Pills

218
00:13:59,560 --> 00:14:00,880
are always half-finished !

219
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:02,640
It just needs half an hour to refine.

220
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:04,200
Once a Heaven Separating Pill is completed,

221
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:05,960
it must be consumed within an hour

222
00:14:06,080 --> 00:14:07,280
or it will be useless.

223
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:12,280
Are you looking for reinforcements from the Burning Fire Alliance ?

224
00:14:12,280 --> 00:14:14,000
Did I allow you to do that !?

225
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:23,040
I'm no match for him,

226
00:14:23,280 --> 00:14:24,080
I only have one way

227
00:14:24,280 --> 00:14:25,200
to shake him off.

228
00:14:27,160 --> 00:14:27,920
Senior,

229
00:14:27,920 --> 00:14:29,720
you're going towards the Burning Fire Country.

230
00:14:29,760 --> 00:14:31,040
It must at least be 3 hours

231
00:14:31,040 --> 00:14:32,480
since the formation broke.

232
00:14:32,520 --> 00:14:33,880
Excluding the time for the Nascent Soul

233
00:14:33,880 --> 00:14:35,440
to get back to deliver the message,

234
00:14:35,880 --> 00:14:36,640
The Fire Spirit Beasts

235
00:14:36,640 --> 00:14:38,440
must have already entered Xuanwu.

236
00:14:39,360 --> 00:14:41,240
The game is over for you !

237
00:14:41,640 --> 00:14:42,880
Now is the time !

238
00:14:44,920 --> 00:14:45,720
What's this?

239
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:54,120
Weren't the Fire Spirit Beasts sealed by the formation ?

240
00:14:54,560 --> 00:14:56,680
Wait, we should report this !

241
00:14:56,920 --> 00:14:57,920
They already know,

242
00:14:58,200 --> 00:14:59,360
don't worry about it.

243
00:15:02,920 --> 00:15:03,600
Shit,

244
00:15:03,680 --> 00:15:04,840
they saw us.

245
00:15:15,880 --> 00:15:19,040
3 days later

246
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:25,320
He appears to be at Foundation Establishment

247
00:15:25,560 --> 00:15:29,120
but he's been using the Earth Escape for 3 days straight to cross the country.

248
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:32,440
The Burning Fire Alliance couldn't resist those beasts

249
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:34,400
so how does he plan to escape them ?

250
00:15:41,800 --> 00:15:42,960
Senior...

251
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:45,520
This... this is the Sea of Devils !

252
00:15:45,720 --> 00:15:46,600
I know.

253
00:15:49,520 --> 00:15:51,480
Maybe someone in the Sea of Devils

254
00:15:51,720 --> 00:15:53,640
might be able to stop the Fire Spirit Beasts.

255
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:57,520
Besides, the Sea of Devils is thousands of times bigger than the Burning Fire Country.

256
00:15:57,600 --> 00:15:59,000
Even the Fire Spirit Beasts

257
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:01,040
will struggle to find us behind this thick fog.

258
00:16:01,280 --> 00:16:01,960
Senior,

259
00:16:02,560 --> 00:16:03,600
am I correct ?

260
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:04,200
Yes.

261
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:07,440
The Sea of Devils I wanted to avoid

262
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:09,720
ended up becoming our only way out.

263
00:16:11,920 --> 00:16:13,480
Cold Yin spiritual energy ?

264
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:22,000
The Sea of Devils is like a wall of ice

265
00:16:22,440 --> 00:16:25,520
that contrasts with the Burning Fire Country's heat.

266
00:16:46,240 --> 00:16:48,040
Everything has a weakness,

267
00:16:48,120 --> 00:16:51,480
this cold fog can suppress Fire Spirit Beasts.

268
00:16:53,200 --> 00:16:54,240
Our priority now

269
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:56,280
is to find a cave and have me reach Core Formation.

270
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:57,900
The only way to survive the Sea of Devils

271
00:16:57,960 --> 00:16:59,920
is to have me form my Golden Core

272
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:02,560
so that I can become the strongest person under Nascent Soul.

273
00:17:04,770 --> 00:19:06,650
Dual Cultivation has multiple meanings. It can just mean a marriage between 2 cultivators.\NBut the second meaning is the exploitation and absorption of spiritual energy through sex (which is the method of the Dual Cultivation Sect that Core Formation cultivator is part of). In that system, the male represents the Yang and the female the Yin, both complementing each other.\N\NIn the event that one is stronger than the other, the weaker (generally the woman) will become the other's "cultivation furnace".\N\NThe term "cultivation furnace" is more widely used for any kind of exploitation of someone else to further one's cultivation.\N\NThat's why he was keeping Li Muwan alive.

274
00:17:10,280 --> 00:17:15,920
I've been walking this path for endless years

275
00:17:12,580 --> 00:17:15,920
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

276
00:17:16,560 --> 00:17:21,520
Is it the compass of fate

277
00:17:18,400 --> 00:17:21,520
that wrote this outcome for us ?

278
00:17:21,680 --> 00:17:27,440
The heavens want to erase your existence,

279
00:17:27,560 --> 00:17:33,160
that's the obsession guiding me.

280
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:38,760
Is this the path to uncover

281
00:17:35,320 --> 00:17:38,760
truths from falsehoods ?

282
00:17:39,040 --> 00:17:44,360
In a world of murk and shadow,

283
00:17:40,940 --> 00:17:44,360
only the flame of truth can light the way.

284
00:17:44,400 --> 00:17:50,080
Look at them all,

285
00:17:47,280 --> 00:17:50,080
being carried by the waves.

286
00:17:50,520 --> 00:17:54,720
Look at them all,

287
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:54,720
being drowned.

288
00:17:54,800 --> 00:17:58,040
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

289
00:17:58,080 --> 00:18:01,120
I will let the world refine my soul.

290
00:18:01,250 --> 00:18:06,680
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

291
00:18:02,940 --> 00:18:06,680
I will fight.

292
00:18:06,680 --> 00:18:09,800
I'll break through the abyss of despair

293
00:18:09,800 --> 00:18:12,840
to finally learn who I really am.

294
00:18:12,840 --> 00:18:18,200
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

295
00:18:14,720 --> 00:18:18,200
I embrace this obsession.

296
00:18:18,200 --> 00:18:21,160
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

297
00:18:21,160 --> 00:18:23,960
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

298
00:18:23,960 --> 00:18:29,440
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

299
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:29,440
I'll still fight.

300
00:18:29,640 --> 00:18:32,800
It's hard to avoid loneliness

301
00:18:32,800 --> 00:18:35,840
when you are above everyone else.

302
00:18:35,840 --> 00:18:41,520
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

303
00:18:38,160 --> 00:18:41,520
be afraid of a firefly ?
